<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0665_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bill</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThat reminds me... Phones turn\nyour voice into electricity to\fcarry it over long distances,\fright?\rSo, if you think about that tech,\nyou could turn homies into\felectricity and send ’em over long\fdistances too, no?\rSo, based on that theory, I came up\nwith and built the Homie\fStorage System! Patent pendin’!\rWell, it ain’t quite as simple as a\nphone, but you get the idea, right?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup, is this {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rThat reminds me... Phones turn\nyour voice into electricity to\fcarry it over long distances,\fright?\rSo, if you think about that tech,\nyou could turn homies into\felectricity and send ’em over long\fdistances too, no?\rSo, based on that theory, I came up\nwith and built the Homie\fStorage System! Patent pendin’!\rWell, it ain’t quite as simple as a\nphone, but you get the idea, right?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who’s callin’?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? Hold up a sec...\r...\n...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Who’s callin’?\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, huh? Hold up a sec...\r...\n...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, you startin’ on the PC Box\nnamed {STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0} right now.\rThat’s a easy name to remember.\nEasy to remember is the move.\rOK, countin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Right now you usin’ the PC Box\nnamed {STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, right?\rThat name go HARD--I deadass like it.\rOK, countin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So your PC Box called\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, right?\rThat ain’t no regular name. I got a\nfeelin’ you know a good name when\fyou see it...\rOK, countin’ the space left in\n{STRVAR_1 11, 10, 0}, you can still hold\f{STRVAR_1 52, 11, 0} more homies in the PC.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Call again sometime...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your PC Boxes full!\rYou gotta release some homies\nif you wanna catch more.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Bill.\rYou know your PC Boxes full, right?\rYou did a crazy job catchin’\nhomies, huh!\rFr, it’s wonderful, I tip my hat!\rThat said, you get that with\nyour Boxes full like that, you can’t\fcatch no more homies?\fJust so you know.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0665_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, this Bill.\rYou know your PC Boxes full, right?\rYou did a crazy job catchin’\nhomies, huh!\rFr, it’s wonderful, I tip my hat!\rThat said, you get that with\nyour Boxes full like that, you can’t\fcatch no more homies?\fJust so you know.</language>
	</row>
</body>
